          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Packaging</h3>

          <p>
            Packaging is the other half of the environmental picture. Method says its standard dish soap bottle, not counting the pump, is made from 100% recycled plastic. Most brands, including Dawn, sell large refill bottles, and buying a big refill to top up a small dispenser cuts plastic per wash more than any formula change will.
          </p>
