          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Dish soap is a small purchase, but the right bottle saves money, protects your hands and keeps the dishwasher from flooding the kitchen floor. Start with Dawn Ultra if you want one soap that handles everything, switch to Seventh Generation Free and Clear for a formula with an outside environmental review, and choose Palmolive Ultra Pure + Clear Unscented if your skin reacts to fragrance.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Whatever you pick, use less than you think, wash in a basin rather than under a running tap, and keep hand dish soap and dishwasher detergent in separate places. Those habits matter more than any brand on the shelf.
